(          The cotton industry touches the lives of) Tj T*
(          the vast majority of the peoples of the) Tj T*
(          earth. The ensuing survey does not pretend) Tj T*
(          to cover the field in all its diversity. It) Tj T*
(          aims to give, in brief compass, such) Tj T*
(          general facts concerning the industry in) Tj T*
(          the United States as may enable the reader) Tj T*
(          quickly to familiarize himself with its) Tj T*
(          broader outlines.) Tj T*
