(The American crop is thus approximately fifty-six per cent. of the) Tj T*
(world's total. The other producing countries have shown since the) Tj T*
(beginning of the century an interesting, if not a remarkable growth, that) Tj T*
(of China being the largest in quantity, and that of Russia, the largest) Tj T*
(in proportion. The American increase has been larger, absolutely, than) Tj T*
(that of any other region, and there is little indication that it will not) Tj T*
(continue to hold first position.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
