(In the manufacture of cotton, Great Britain's supremacy, while not so) Tj T*
(great proportionately as that of America in growing it, is for the) Tj T*
(present not likely to be challenged. The following table of the number of) Tj T*
(spindles in the chief manufacturing countries is based on English figures) Tj T*
(compiled shortly before the outbreak of the World War. The number of) Tj T*
(spindles is the usual basis upon which the size of the industry is) Tj T*
(judged. It is not a perfect method, but it has fewer objections than any) Tj T*
(other:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
