(The North, having this growing interest in an industry struggling against) Tj T*
(the experience and ability of the more firmly established English market,) Tj T*
(sought naturally for the protection given by a high tariff. The South,) Tj T*
(having definitely dropped manufacturing, pleaded with Congress always for) Tj T*
(a low tariff, and the right to deal in human chattels.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There is little need to go further into the rift which began to develop) Tj T*
(almost immediately. In 1861 the split occurred. The war between the) Tj T*
(States caused hardly more suffering than the blockade which cut off the) Tj T*
(spinners of Manchester from the vegetable wool which supplied them the) Tj T*
(means of living. Cotton proved its power and its domination. It was a) Tj T*
(beneficent monarch, but it brooked no denial of its overlordship.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
