(of cotton reached the stage of an industry. There conditions are almost) Tj T*
(ideal, apparently, for the production of a great crop; yet, for many) Tj T*
(years the crop was a small one, and was utilized locally in the domestic) Tj T*
(manufacture of the light clothing worn by the people. Nothing remotely) Tj T*
(resembling the present modern factory system developed during all the) Tj T*
(thousands of years that the Indians had the field practically to) Tj T*
(themselves. The plant grown in India for a long time produced a short,) Tj T*
