(The Growing Importance) Tj T*
(Of Egyptian Staples) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Egyptian crop is one of the most interesting, both in the methods) Tj T*
(of culture, and in the product. From the point of view of) Tj T*
(statistics--remembering the uncertainty of the size of the Chinese) Tj T*
(crop--Egypt is the third cotton growing country of the world. This is) Tj T*
(the more interesting because it was not until about 1820 that Egypt was) Tj T*
(considered as a source of supply. The present area, under extremely) Tj T*
(intensive cultivation, is about 1,800,000 acres, and nine-tenths of this) Tj T*
(is in the Nile delta.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Climatic conditions are radically different from those of the United) Tj T*
(States. Little rain falls during the growing season, but an elaborate) Tj T*
(system of irrigation provides a sufficient and probably more satisfactory) Tj T*
(water supply, insomuch as the quantity of water can be regulated, and) Tj T*
(there is little danger of either too much or too little moisture. The) Tj T*
(regions where the soil is not composed exclusively of the black delta) Tj T*
(mud, but is a mixture of sand and mud, produce the best crops. The land,) Tj T*
(after being plowed, is thrown up into ridges about three feet apart.) Tj T*
(Channels for water are formed at right angles to the ridges. The seeds,) Tj T*
(before being sown, in March, are thoroughly soaked, and after the) Tj T*
(seedlings appear there is frequent hoeing and watering. The total water) Tj T*
(is equivalent to a rainfall of about 35 inches. There is little) Tj T*
(cultivation in the American fashion, hand labor being employed almost) Tj T*
(exclusively. The result of all this intensive effort is an abundant crop) Tj T*
(of long-stapled cotton with an extremely strong fiber, bringing in the) Tj T*
(open market a price second only to that of the American Sea Island) Tj T*
(variety. Much of the Egyptian cotton is used in the manufacture of) Tj T*
(hosiery and other knit goods, sateens, sewing thread, etc., but recently) Tj T*
(it has also been found to be exceedingly well fitted for the manufacture) Tj T*
