(the presence of a market close at hand which grew so rapidly, more) Tj T*
(rapidly indeed than the industry could grow to meet it. Aided to some) Tj T*
(extent by an import tariff, the manufacturers have weathered some short) Tj T*
(periods of depression, but in the main the industry has grown in direct) Tj T*
(ratio to the growth of the country.) Tj T*
