(multitude of channels, and, he will deal with small garment manufacturers) Tj T*
(and makers of all kinds of wares, and will also sell considerable) Tj T*
(quantities to the larger cutters when they are unable, for one reason or) Tj T*
(another, to buy direct from the mills or from the converters. There are) Tj T*
(also numerous small jobbing concerns which buy substantial quantities) Tj T*
(from the larger jobbers as occasion may require.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(One of the greatest avenues of outlet is through a class of dealers known) Tj T*
(as converters, and there are converters operating in every kind of fabric) Tj T*
(from cotton to silk. In the last forty or fifty years, this business has) Tj T*
(developed into immense proportions, and the converter performs a real and) Tj T*
(important service in the trade. He is intimately acquainted with the) Tj T*
(needs of his customers, and possesses a fair knowledge of the kinds of) Tj T*
(goods put out by the various mills and the different constructions in) Tj T*
(which they are sold, and is well acquainted with all of the market) Tj T*
