(understanding of the various treatments accorded to the goods. He buys) Tj T*
(his goods in the gray from the mills, and sends them to the finishers,) Tj T*
(printers, etc., to be treated, according to his instructions. By a) Tj T*
(careful studying of the fabric constructions, and of the subsequent) Tj T*
(treatments, he is able to create fabrics of a suitable and marketable) Tj T*
(character, which are in some respects different from those offered by any) Tj T*
(of his competitors, and which are brought out with an exact knowledge of) Tj T*
(the requirements of the trade to which he is catering. He is able to make) Tj T*
(a profit, and generally a very substantial one, by handling the goods in) Tj T*
(this way.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
