(which is issued for convenient periods of time, averaging perhaps four) Tj T*
(months, is much sought after by banks and other institutions in primary) Tj T*
(markets and throughout the country wishing to invest current funds in a) Tj T*
(safe and not unprofitable medium. This paper is so acceptable to banks) Tj T*
(not only because the credit of the issuing firm is behind it, but also) Tj T*
(because it is known that the money which is obtained for the notes will) Tj T*
(be lent out to mills on ample collateral. The issuing house is in a) Tj T*
(position so entirely safe that hardly ever can a question arise as to its) Tj T*
(ability to take care of its borrowings.) Tj T*
