(store, usually charging interest based on the monthly statement of their) Tj T*
(ledger accounts. He in turn receives the necessary accommodation for his) Tj T*
(own purchases from the local bank, or from the local buyer or factor with) Tj T*
(whom he is affiliated. The high prices prevailing during the past few) Tj T*
(years have undoubtedly changed to some extent the small grower's) Tj T*
(financial position.) Tj T*
