(It is encouraging to note that the war brought about, under Government) Tj T*
(auspices, a very definite movement for the improvement of the bale. The) Tj T*
(proposal demands the installation of high pressure baling machines at the) Tj T*
(gin, capable of producing a bale with a density of thirty-five pounds a) Tj T*
(cubic foot. The trading unit in cotton is one hundred bales, and such a) Tj T*
(compression would mean that one hundred bales could be loaded into a) Tj T*
(single freight car, and shipped directly to the export point or) Tj T*
(warehouse. The present practice requires three cars to carry the ginnery) Tj T*
(bales to the compressor, and two cars to carry the compressed bales to) Tj T*
(the port, warehouse, or mill. The saving in freight and handling is) Tj T*
(obvious. It needs only a glance at the photograph of the two bales side) Tj T*
(by side to see the possible saving in waste and "city crop," or tare. The) Tj T*
(obstacles in the way of such an improvement are those which face any) Tj T*
(revolutionary change in commercial methods. Established practice,) Tj T*
(invested capital, and the natural conservatism of human nature militate) Tj T*
(against quick improvement.) Tj T*
