(       position close against the thread which has preceded it by) Tj T*
(       means of the reed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    4. Letting-off, or permitting the warp to unwind from the beam only) Tj T*
(       just as fast as is needed by the speed of the weaving. This is) Tj T*
