(The question of nationality has had an important bearing upon the) Tj T*
(development of the industry in the United States. The constant influx) Tj T*
(into the country of successive waves of immigration from the different) Tj T*
(countries of Europe has often served in a decade to change the whole) Tj T*
(complexion of the labor question. In the original New England mills, the) Tj T*
(employees were of almost pure English stock. The sons and daughters of) Tj T*
(the Yankee farmers entered the mills, not as a permanent occupation, but) Tj T*
(merely as a means of getting a start in life.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Just before the Civil War, the Irish began to come rapidly, and the) Tj T*
(actual advent of that struggle saw a great number of the remaining) Tj T*
(natives leaving for the army, or thrown out of work. When the fighting) Tj T*
(was over they did not return, but the Irish came in even greater numbers.) Tj T*
(The next decade saw the arrival of the French Canadians in the New) Tj T*
(England states, and there also came, in quick succession, natives of) Tj T*
(Italy, and of the various states of eastern Europe.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Illustration: _Baled cloth being put aboard waiting freight cars_]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This change in the national complexion had two very important results. It) Tj T*
(brought into the country a constant stream of cheap labor, polyglot, and) Tj T*
(lacking in homogeneity, and consequently slow at first to unionize and) Tj T*
(strike. This characteristic brought another in its train--a lack of) Tj T*
(stability, and a proneness to transiency. The second result was hardly) Tj T*
(less important. It meant that though labor was relatively plentiful, much) Tj T*
(of it was unskilled. This lack of skill put a premium upon quantity) Tj T*
(production, and led to efforts to develop automatic machinery and) Tj T*
(labor-saving devices of all kinds. It compelled most American) Tj T*
(manufacturers to specialize upon the coarser kinds of yarns and cloths,) Tj T*
(made in simple weaves and patterns, in the making of which the minimum) Tj T*
(amount of skilled labor was required.) Tj T*
ET
